+ * Named slots: mon0 (QMP), gdb0 (gdbstub), hci0 (Bluetooth H:4).
+ * gdb_attach/detach request OPENED/CLOSED on the QEMU-thread drain timer
+ * so the stub does not freeze
  * the guest at boot and events are not raised from the browser thread.
